Original upstream READMEs, licenses, tokenizers and weights retain their names.
Local provenance, compatibility notes and hashes: ../archive-metadata/
VERIFIED.json exists only after every upstream file passes its source hash.

Offline integrity check from any snapshot directory:
  sha256sum -c ../archive-metadata/SHA256SUMS

Removing an inventory entry does not delete its snapshots.

